    <cap:headline>Heavy Rain</cap:headline>
    <cap:description>Heavy to Very Heavy Rainfall at a few places with Extremely Heavy Falls at isolated places very likely over Kerala and Mahe and Karnataka (Coastal and adjoining ghat areas); Heavy to Very Heavy Rainfall at a few places
over Konkan and Goa and at isolated places over Lakshadweep and Tamil Nadu, Puducherry and Karaikal.</cap:description>
    <cap:instruction>Action suggested:
•	Avoid going to areas that face the water logging problems often.
•	Avoid staying in vulnerable structure.
•	Check for traffic congestion on your route before journey.</cap:instruction>
